---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy - Fragrant Signatures" 
  description="Privacy Policy for Fragrant Signatures - how we collect, use, and protect your personal data."
  currentPath="/en/privacy"
  lang="en"
>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-lavender-50 via-white to-perfume-50">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-16 max-w-4xl">
      <!-- Hero Section -->
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl bg-gradient-to-r from-perfume-600 to-rose-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent mb-4">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-lavender-600">
          Last updated: November 2024
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 shadow-xl border border-lavender-200">
        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
          <div class="space-y-8 text-lavender-800">
            <!-- Introduction -->
            <section>
              <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
                Fragrant Signatures (<strong>info@fragrant-signatures.eu</strong>) respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal data. This privacy policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your data when you use our website.
              </p>
            </section>

            <!-- Section 1 -->
            <section>
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-lavender-800 mb-4">1. Data We Collect</h2>
              
              <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-lavender-700 mb-3 mt-6">Data you provide directly:</h3>
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-lavender-700">
                <li><strong>First and last name</strong> — when you complete the contact form</li>
                <li><strong>Email address</strong> — for communication and responding to your inquiries</li>
                <li><strong>Message and subject</strong> — so we can respond to your inquiry</li>
                <li><strong>Order information</strong> — if you order a product or service</li>
              </ul>

              <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-lavender-700 mb-3 mt-6">Data collected automatically:</h3>
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-lavender-700">
                <li><strong>Cookies and tracking technologies</strong> — for analytics, marketing, and improving user experience</li>
                <li><strong>IP address and browser information</strong> — for security and technical purposes</li>
                <li><strong>Website activity data</strong> — pages you visit, visit duration, interactions</li>
              </ul>
            </section>

            <!-- Section 2 -->
            <section>
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-lavender-800 mb-4">2. How We Use Your Data</h2>
              <p class="mb-3">We use your personal data exclusively for the following purposes:</p>
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-lavender-700">
                <li>Responding to your inquiries and communicating with you</li>
                <li>Processing orders and providing services</li>
                <li>Improving website functionality and content</li>
                <li>Measuring the effectiveness of marketing campaigns (e.g., Meta ads, Google Ads)</li>
                <li>Personalizing your experience and displaying relevant content</li>
                <li>Protection against fraud, spam, and abuse</li>
              </ul>
            </section>

            <!-- Section 3 -->
            <section>
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-lavender-800 mb-4">3. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
              <p class="mb-3">Our website uses cookies for the following purposes:</p>
              
              <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-lavender-700 mb-3 mt-6">Essential cookies (required):</h3>
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-lavender-700">
                <li>Enable basic website functionality</li>
                <li>Store your privacy settings and cookie consent</li>
              </ul>

              <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-lavender-700 mb-3 mt-6">Marketing cookies (optional, require consent):</h3>
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-lavender-700">
                <li><strong>Meta (Facebook) Pixel</strong> — measuring and optimizing Meta ads, retargeting</li>
                <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> — analyzing visits, traffic sources, and user behavior</li>
                <li><strong>Google Ads</strong> — tracking conversions and measuring ad effectiveness</li>
              </ul>

              <p class="mt-4 text-lavender-700">
                You can disable marketing cookies at any time by changing your browser's cookie settings or by contacting us.
              </p>
            </section>

            <!-- Section 4 -->
            <section>
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-lavender-800 mb-4">4. Sharing Data with Third Parties</h2>
              <p class="mb-3">We do not sell or rent your personal data to third parties. We may share data only in the following situations:</p>
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-lavender-700">
                <li><strong>Meta (Facebook)</strong> — for measuring ad effectiveness and retargeting campaigns</li>
                <li><strong>Google</strong> — for analytics and measuring ad effectiveness</li>
                <li><strong>Service providers</strong> — HostGator, Vercel, email services (only to the extent necessary for providing services)</li>
                <li><strong>Legal obligations</strong> — if required by law or court order</li>
              </ul>
              <p class="mt-4 text-lavender-700">
                All our business partners are required to protect your data in accordance with GDPR regulations and appropriate privacy standards.
              </p>
            </section>

            <!-- Section 5 -->
            <section>
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-lavender-800 mb-4">5. Your Rights</h2>
              <p class="mb-3">In accordance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), you have the following rights:</p>
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-lavender-700">
                <li><strong>Right of access</strong> — you can request a copy of all data we hold about you</li>
                <li><strong>Right to rectification</strong> — you can request correction of inaccurate or incomplete data</li>
                <li><strong>Right to erasure</strong> — you can request deletion of your personal data</li>
                <li><strong>Right to restriction of processing</strong> — you can restrict how we use your data</li>
                <li><strong>Right to data portability</strong> — you can request transfer of your data to another service provider</li>
                <li><strong>Right to object</strong> — you can object to processing of your data for marketing purposes</li>
                <li><strong>Right to withdraw consent</strong> — you can withdraw consent to cookie usage at any time</li>
              </ul>
              <p class="mt-4 text-lavender-700">
                To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at <a href="mailto:info@fragrant-signatures.eu" class="text-perfume-600 hover:text-perfume-700 underline">info@fragrant-signatures.eu</a>.
              </p>
            </section>

            <!-- Section 6 -->
            <section>
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-lavender-800 mb-4">6. Data Security</h2>
              <p class="text-lavender-700">
                We use appropriate technical and organizational security measures to protect your personal data from unauthorized access, loss, misuse, or alteration. All data is transmitted via encrypted HTTPS protocol.
              </p>
            </section>

            <!-- Section 7 -->
            <section>
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-lavender-800 mb-4">7. Data Retention</h2>
              <p class="text-lavender-700">
                We retain your personal data only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purpose for which it was collected or as required by law. Contact form data is typically retained for up to 2 years, unless you request earlier deletion.
              </p>
            </section>

            <!-- Section 8 -->
            <section>
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-lavender-800 mb-4">8. Links to Other Websites</h2>
              <p class="text-lavender-700">
                Our website may contain links to external sites (e.g., social networks). We are not responsible for the privacy policies of those sites and recommend that you read their privacy policies before sharing personal data.
              </p>
            </section>

            <!-- Section 9 -->
            <section>
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-lavender-800 mb-4">9. Changes to Privacy Policy</h2>
              <p class="text-lavender-700">
                We reserve the right to periodically update this privacy policy. All changes will be posted on this page with a new update date. We recommend checking this page periodically.
              </p>
            </section>

            <!-- Section 10 -->
            <section>
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-lavender-800 mb-4">10. Contact</h2>
              <p class="text-lavender-700 mb-3">
                For any questions about this privacy policy or the processing of your personal data, contact us:
              </p>
              <div class="bg-lavender-50 p-4 rounded-lg">
                <p class="text-lavender-800"><strong>Fragrant Signatures</strong></p>
                <p class="text-lavender-700">Email: <a href="mailto:info@fragrant-signatures.eu" class="text-perfume-600 hover:text-perfume-700 underline">info@fragrant-signatures.eu</a></p>
                <p class="text-lavender-700">Location: Croatia</p>
              </div>
            </section>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Navigation -->
      <div class="mt-12 flex justify-center">
        <a 
          href="/kontakt" 
          class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-perfume-600 to-rose-500 text-white rounded-lg hover:from-perfume-700 hover:to-rose-600 transition-all duration-300 transform hover:scale-105 font-medium"
        >
          ← Back to Contact
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
